{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026yUTPS2rNmK1792763619.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>新皇崗口岸明天迎來第二個周末。入境處提醒使用該口岸過關的家庭，可以預先在網上登記，加快過關速度。</p><p></p><p>家長可以透過自己的「香港E-道」應用程式，替持有香港身份證的7至17歲子女登記，輸入身份證號碼，核實親子關係後，便可完成登記。除了應用程式，亦可帶同子女到皇崗口岸的合作查驗E-道登記處，或自助服務站進行登記。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T14:04:40.807424+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T17:38:11.858762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:11.637581+00:00","content_hash":"ff12cc1dc2df3bf533b25621c7d5ac16a5b8eea19d952f7991c2008ad2a69bb1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}